<title>BELGIUM: Belgian regional newspaper group reorganises.</title>
<headline>Belgian regional newspaper group reorganises.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Belgium's Vers l'Avenir newspaper group said on Thursday it had regrouped its titles within a new company, Editions de l'Avenir SA.</p>
<p>The new group would comprise the daily titles L'Avenir du Luxembourg, Le Courrier de l'Escaut, Le Rappel, Le Jour-Le Courrier and flagship Vers l'Avenir and the weekly title Le Courrier de Philippeville.</p>
<p>The group's total readership is around 608,000, it said in a statement.</p>
<p>-- Nick Antonovics, Brussels Newsroom +32 2 287 6817, Fax +32 2 230 7710</p>
